(7722856, 1271239, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strong, beautiful, engaging, compelling, utterly guileless.  It''s magic to see that she will have her story, her path and, hopefully, her wisdom.  Can''t be more present than she is.  Is Ellis a girl, seeing that it''s usually a boy''s name?  Not important. <br/>Wonderful depth of focus.  Anything other than black and white might dilute the mood.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Strong, beautiful, engaging, compelling, utterly guileless.  It''s magic to see that she will have her story, her path and, hopefully, her wisdom.  Can''t be more present than she is.  Is Ellis a girl, seeing that it''s usually a boy''s name?  Not important. Wonderful depth of focus.  Anything other than black and white might dilute the mood.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2022-07-06 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7722859, 1271235, 173844, '<td valign="top">I see stardom in a heavy metal band.  "O sprey do you see?"  Pumped up to destroy a stadium near you!<br/>Splendid detail in the feathers.  So neat to see the lamination of the beak.  The delicacy of the irises.</td>', 'I see stardom in a heavy metal band.  "O sprey do you see?"  Pumped up to destroy a stadium near you!Splendid detail in the feathers.  So neat to see the lamination of the beak.  The delicacy of the irises.', '2022-07-06 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
